    {
        "text": "(Amiya...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The situation in Chernobog has become very complicated. We can't afford to create extra pressure for the rescue team. But...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "(How much time... do we have left?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...Three hours.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "(After three hours, this entire city will be consumed by the Catastrophe.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "(After that, everything will be over then.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
